From a02af8257192b0ace80b7a995ba64b0b4468dea5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SpotPalette <spotpalette@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:00:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CmdPal: Spotlight-style search bar customization

Builds on Command Palette's compact mode (search box only, expands while
typing) and adds a 'Spotlight search bar style' group to Settings >
Appearance: visible result rows, search text size, search bar height,
corner roundness, and toggles for the app icon, section headers and the
bottom command bar. The official full palette is unaffected.

Also: SpotPaletteRelease=true builds behave like official builds (no dev
ribbon or internal tools), and the Dev package starts with Windows.
